    say says said saying go goes went gone going
    get gets got getting make makes made making
    know knows knew known knowing think thinks thought thinking
    take takes took taken taking see sees saw seen seeing
    come comes came coming want wants wanted wanting
    look looks looked looking give gives gave given giving
    find finds found finding tell tells told telling
    feel feels felt feeling leave leaves left leaving
    put puts putting mean means meant meaning
    keep keeps kept keeping let lets letting
    begin begins began begun beginning seem seems seemed seeming
    help helps helped helping show shows showed shown showing
    hear hears heard hearing play plays played playing
    run runs ran running live lives lived living
    hold holds held holding bring brings brought bringing
    write writes wrote written writing sit sits sat sitting
    stand stands stood standing lose loses lost losing
    meet meets met meeting learn learns learned learning
    lead leads led leading understand understands understood understanding
    watch watches watched watching follow follows followed following
    stop stops stopped stopping speak speaks spoke spoken speaking
    read reads reading grow grows grew grown growing
    open opens opened opening walk walks walked walking
    win wins won winning die dies died dying
    build builds built building fall falls fell fallen falling
    cut cuts cutting kill kills killed killing
    send sends sent sending fight fights fought fighting
    eat eats ate eaten eating drink drinks drank drunk drinking
    sleep sleeps slept sleeping love loves loved loving
    hate hates hated hating fear fears feared fearing
    hope hopes hoped hoping
    body head eye eyes ear ears nose mouth lip lips tooth teeth tongue
    throat neck shoulder arm hand finger thumb foot feet toe knee leg
    heart blood bone skin hair back gut belly chest brain
    mother father sister brother son daughter child children wife husband
    man woman friend folk
    sun moon star earth land water sea hill field wood tree leaf
    stone rock fire light dark day night morning evening
    rain snow ice wind storm cloud bird fish wolf fox bear deer dog cat
    thing something nothing anything everything
    time life death world way word thought mind soul truth
    good bad great small little big long short high low
    old young new hot cold hard soft deep wide
    fast slow strong weak free heaven hell god ghost
    house home room door bed knife sword hammer
)

