    importance difference experience influence
    presence absence evidence distance instance substance assistance
    performance appearance circumstance balance chance
    ability possibility responsibility opportunity
    community quality reality authority security activity society identity
    university city
    possible impossible probable certain important different similar necessary
    natural official special general personal original final total
    public private civil human perfect complete simple difficult
    major minor proper common usual immediate separate able capable
    accept receive perceive admit commit submit permit
    announce appear arrive assist resist exist assume consume
    attend intend extend cause pause compare prepare
    compose propose suppose conclude include exclude
    conduct produce reduce introduce consider desire require
    contain obtain maintain continue correct direct elect select
    create decide provide declare define demand depend
    describe design destroy determine develop discuss disturb divide
    educate employ enjoy enter escape examine expect respect explain
    express impress force form inform reform perform
    ignore imagine improve approve prove increase indicate insist
    inspire invite involve judge observe preserve serve occur offer
    oppose order organize pass pay place point possess practice prefer
